[{"client_msg_id":"347aae0f-2fa0-4a5f-9c4d-8508e86a55e1","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"つまりはいう事聞いて勉強した時点で負け、か","ts":"1630681152.030400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DkL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f155b44a-1f5a-4964-a9c2-17f1597ec883","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"このツッコミ入れた時点からその上司か会社との戦闘開始すね","ts":"1630681088.029100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yClma"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da368de2-5671-4c3e-bbf6-4ab85bf724ae","type":"message","user":"UCL78DG68","text":"\u0026gt; 期限や方法、場所、時間など制約のない自宅学習なら労働時間性は否定される\n旨の判決が大阪高裁平成22年に出ており、続く文章でも\n\n\u0026gt; 資格取得をした従業員には褒賞や費用の会社負担、評価上の加点などメリットを付与するが、資格取得をしていない従業員には、そういった利益付与はないものの、不利益を与えることでもない場合には、資格取得は会社から示された目標、勧奨であって、「義務づけられ、又は余儀なくされる」とは言えず、したがって指揮命令下に置かれていないので、労働時間には当たらない、という整理ができます。\nとのことです。\n社会通念上はブラックでも違法性は無い（と法的整理されてしまう）ケースかもしれません。","ts":"1630681080.028900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lgyH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3958ad02-ff98-4396-9e80-f4451c5d478a","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"一応言っておくと","ts":"1630681055.028200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IX2U3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd5b3b30-0cd6-4697-a6b9-ffaf44ac5896","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"なんかやっぱり無理に納得しようとしたなというのが自覚出てきて、ここで吐きだしてよかったです。","ts":"1630681034.027700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"17c0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69d33957-c797-4855-b3ac-1def6a36a300","type":"message","user":"UCL78DG68","text":"managerをやっていたときに同様の話題で人事・法務と議論したときに参照した記事があるので参考までに。\n\n\u003chttps://fumijichannel.com/1767/\u003e","ts":"1630680979.026800","attachments":[{"fallback":"ふみじ労働チャンネル: 会社の指示で資格取得のための自宅学習をした時間は労働時間か","id":1,"title":"会社の指示で資格取得のための自宅学習をした時間は労働時間か","title_link":"https://fumijichannel.com/1767/","text":"　従業員の能力向上を図り、担当業務の拡大や専門性を高めることを意図して、会社が従業員に特定の資格試験の受験を指示又は推奨した場合、従業員が自宅学習に要した時間は労働時間となるのでしょうか。　　　労働時間とは使用者の指揮命令下に置かれている時","image_url":"https://fumijichannel.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/150912536038-scaled-e1622632433712.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1615608061,"service_name":"ふみじ労働チャンネル","service_icon":"https://fumijichannel.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/cropped-20201223-2-1-180x180.jpg","from_url":"https://fumijichannel.com/1767/","original_url":"https://fumijichannel.com/1767/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"pray","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mwU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef3e2642-3809-448d-a162-396d69248993","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"この辺りか","ts":"1630680976.026700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GIW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb262d8d-3f31-4853-9c34-ddddf25038c8","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"ツッコミどころとしては\nそれ業務命令でしょ？\nなんで業務時間外をお給料もなしに会社のために使わんとならんの？\n文書にしてないって時点で違法だという認識あるんでしょ？","ts":"1630680971.026400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"weJ0U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"535754cc-3693-41bf-961e-a83dd385b2c6","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"目標立てさせるなら業務扱いにしてもらわんとだし\n業務時間外にやらせるのがおかしい","ts":"1630680775.023500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e1Hxq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a26e09df-46d5-4591-a40c-fbdde38a3b9d","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"しかも目標まで立てさせるってモロプライベートに干渉する気満々で\n文書にもしてないって時点で揉めた時に有耶無耶にしたいとしか思えん","ts":"1630680659.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KLk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd2e66f2-0064-4e4a-93d4-30b9a47ad2fa","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"人事評価に加えるって時点でそれ業務命令でしょ","ts":"1630680364.019800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yahari","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LmgCv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b7c57a68-2787-4c06-8594-dd155ed2e2ea","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"意識に余計なバイアス生むだけだ。","ts":"1630680100.019300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zAKFC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d2d41b4-4b3b-4200-98f9-be6d24502767","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"そうですね。期待する理由はとくにないですね。","ts":"1630680060.019000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XcG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a452c6c-2c6b-445d-9ca5-19f98a451ed8","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そこはニュートラルにとらえておいた方が良いと思うよ。","ts":"1630680036.018500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g8b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"059f6199-2bf8-4dda-b777-0dec1e1520e8","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"使ってる人がいなくて有名無実化してるんですけど、私の入社前から勤務時間でkaggleしていいって制度があるので、会社としてはプライベートで学習しろやって態度ではないと期待。","ts":"1630679856.017800","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1630679875.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iKg8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91dd57b3-f22c-4f91-98e8-14de30cd56f7","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"能力開発の内容についてマネージャーと話し合って決定する場があるので、念の為、録音しておこうと思います。","ts":"1630679682.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tmV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"52198b09-4b91-4fc1-b12a-cc05705763d0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"録音してエスカレーションするか労基に直接かも。","ts":"1630679592.015100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l2o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1adfc3c5-6ceb-4e26-9d55-1fbbcee3f5a2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"まぁそれ自体、上層部の意向かもだけども。","ts":"1630679517.013900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G14u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3c82ac5e-d967-496c-9707-ec6f1df299df","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"さらに口だけで話してると、それは会社にとってもマネージャーの背信行為になると思う。","ts":"1630679499.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LF14"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1195fc71-2896-4db9-b24e-ebd8bc6eb308","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":black_square:","ts":"1630679443.012800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Au//"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0204b68-241a-4212-8962-6f3cdafee78e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"プライベートな学習を査定に加える≒業務外の時間に一定のバイアスをかけるだから、かなりまずいと思うよ。","ts":"1630679436.012600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]},{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rKDfS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5ba5f2a6-9aa6-4ce7-ae76-64c1483bbb05","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"一人は、会社は教育機関ではないと主張しており物言う気が失せました","ts":"1630679185.010600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"otNuG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26e4dd16-4ec7-4913-b530-0298773a4c27","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"なんでプライベートなんだ","ts":"1630679141.009900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5beVl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3640318d-20a1-4c93-b03a-03070c8a27f1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"もうすでにアウトでしょ","ts":"1630679073.009700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M+a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fece067a-f010-47e5-82bc-2f279a846ac7","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"タチが悪いのが、文書にはなってなくて、マネージャー2名が口で言ってるんですよね。","ts":"1630679057.009400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"yamaiyatsu","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NXL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1328d89-9867-4e87-8df7-9db8fae53714","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いやー普通に労基違反な気がするなw","ts":"1630678971.008400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=om"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17bdf3bb-3f7d-4c67-9e99-21b5c2023465","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"とりあえず、新評価基準に対する質問・意見を求められているので\n「マイナス査定しないでくれ。やってしまうと、実質業務やし、使える時間に個人差ありすぎて不公平や」\nと主張しておきました。","ts":"1630678792.007900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UTx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c599d5d-be6c-4fab-b039-15ea25f7f6eb","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"かなりグレーですよね。マイナス査定として扱わないなら……って気はします。","ts":"1630676957.004100","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1630676985.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"98dfQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0224aade-6438-4cb7-9cb4-eac7b38794cb","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"プライベートの学習を強要するのは違法では、いや知らんけども","ts":"1630676926.003500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B02G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3f68cfb-02bc-49f3-b77c-5769cbeec31e","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"*すみませんグチです。\n人事評価にプライベートでの学習が加わることになって、それ自体はいいんですけど、会社の四半期ごとの目標に沿っていると主張できる学習が対象らしくて、しかも期の頭に数値目標宣言しないといけないのだるいです……。沿ってなくても仕事に役立った勉強内容は積極アピールして別の軸で評価してもらうのがいいのかなあ。","ts":"1630676857.003100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8XO"}]}]
